</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/698317e4-747d-11f1-a1bc-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/Capture-3577.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/698317e4-747d-11f1-a1bc-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/Capture-3577.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">780ea168-747b-11f1-aa98-a9eac3931ee8</guid><pubDate>Tue, 30 Jun 2026 12:37:14 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/698317e4-747d-11f1-a1bc-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/Capture-3577.jpg">© 网络图片</source><dc:creator>弗林</dc:creator></item><item><category>科技与文化</category><title>美游说机构放弃代理阿里、腾讯等上五角大楼清单巨头 遵守限游说新规</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E7%A7%91%E6%8A%80%E4%B8%8E%E6%96%87%E5%8C%96/20260630-%E7%BE%8E%E6%B8%B8%E8%AF%B4%E6%9C%BA%E6%9E%84%E6%94%BE%E5%BC%83%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E9%98%BF%E9%87%8C-%E8%85%BE%E8%AE%AF%E7%AD%89%E4%B8%8A%E4%BA%94%E8%A7%92%E5%A4%A7%E6%A5%BC%E6%B8%85%E5%8D%95%E5%B7%A8%E5%A4%B4-%E9%81%B5%E5%AE%88%E9%99%90%E6%B8%B8%E8%AF%B4%E6%96%B0%E8%A7%84</link><description>
