</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/105a5f32-7479-11f1-ab4e-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/Capture-3576.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/105a5f32-7479-11f1-ab4e-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/Capture-3576.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">b279f624-746f-11f1-9def-432894e2c7a6</guid><pubDate>Tue, 30 Jun 2026 11:48:04 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/105a5f32-7479-11f1-ab4e-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/Capture-3576.jpg">© 路透社图片</source><dc:creator>弗林</dc:creator></item><item><category>社会</category><title>美做市商海纳起诉百人 指借中国整治跨境券商内幕信息获利逾1亿美元</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A/20260630-%E7%BE%8E%E5%81%9A%E5%B8%82%E5%95%86%E6%B5%B7%E7%BA%B3%E8%B5%B7%E8%AF%89%E7%99%BE%E4%BA%BA-%E6%8C%87%E5%80%9F%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E6%95%B4%E6%B2%BB%E8%B7%A8%E5%A2%83%E5%88%B8%E5%95%86%E5%86%85%E5%B9%95%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E8%8E%B7%E5%88%A9%E9%80%BE1%E4%BA%BF%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83</link><description>
